ity isn't specified.)\n   - All basketball players are tall.\n   - Tall people wear large shoes.\n   - People who wear large shoes wear large-sized clothes.\n   - Yuri does not wear large-sized clothes.\n\n2. **Logical Deduction:**\n   - Since Yuri doesn't wear large-sized clothes, he doesn't wear large shoes.\n   - Not wearing large shoes means he isn't tall.\n   - Not being tall means he isn't a basketball player.\n   - Therefore, Yuri isn't a basketball player.\n\n3. **Conclusion:**\n   - Since Yuri isn't a basketball player, he can't be an American basketball player.\n   - The statement \"Yuri is not an American basketball player\" is true.\n\n**Answer:** A) True.",
